  "description": "Eclipse Zenoh for IoTCom.Net: a session endpoint with put, delete, subscriptions as events and IAsyncEnumerable, queryables and get, a read-only switch, traffic tap, the IPublisher/ISubscriber abstractions, pure C# key-expression matching and an in-process virtual network. The native binding to the Rust zenoh crate is not shipped in this release (a security advisory in a zenoh dependency); build iotcom_zenoh from source to use it. Built by Gravicode Studios, led by Kang Fadhil.",
